Breeze Dark, from KDE's breeze-icons 6.31.0
(https://invent.kde.org/frameworks/breeze-icons), under the GNU LGPL: see
COPYING-ICONS and COPYING.LIB.

This is a part of the theme, made with tools/build-breeze-dark.py: the icons
Power Theme uses, at their plain sizes, with those Breeze Dark inherits from
Breeze. The icons themselves are unchanged.

It stands in until Power Theme has a dark version of the Haiku icons.
